## SQ-ATC-01
@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `ArmorTrimsLargeItemListsMixin`, `armor_trims`, `LargeItemLists`
@pass No mixin warning or error for the new mixin; Armor Trims' common setup runs (no exception from `LargeItemLists`)
@fails Injection failure: the 1.3.3 method descriptors in the mixin (`getAllItemsOfType(Ljava/lang/Class;)`, `getAllTrimmable()`); a crash at setup: `ArmorTrimsItemCache.ready()` true too early
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException|Critical injection failure|InjectionError).*ArmorTrimsLargeItemListsMixin
bootreject (?i)(WARN|ERROR).*ArmorTrimsLargeItemListsMixin
bootreject (?i)exception.*(LargeItemLists|armor_?trims)
shell grep -niE "ArmorTrimsLargeItemListsMixin|LargeItemLists" logs/latest.log logs/debug.log | head -5 | cut -c1-240; true
look no line above is a warning or error (an INFO mixin line is fine); Armor Trims' setup ran (SQ-ATC-02 answers)
## SQ-ATC-02 | Armor Trims cache correctness
@group same
@commands `/atctest` (correctness)
@pass `INFO ATC-01` 1 class; `PASS ATC-02` (trimmable items = every ArmorItem + every item of Armor Trims' trimmable tags, none missing or extra); `PASS ATC-04` (ArmorItem list = registry scan); `PASS ATC-05` (chestplate in, stick out)
@fails Missing / extra ids: compare with the uncached jar's ATC-02 line; an entry present only uncached means the cache was filled before tags loaded
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> atctest
waitlog \[atctest\] (PASS|FAIL) ATC-06 300
expect \[atctest\] INFO ATC-01: 1 trimmable class
expect \[atctest\] \S+ ATC-02: getAllTrimmable 50 entries
expect \[atctest\] PASS ATC-04
expect \[atctest\] PASS ATC-05

## SQ-ATC-03 | Armor Trims cache performance
@group same
@commands Same run (performance): read `ATC-03`, `ATC-06`
@pass `PASS ATC-03` (second call returns the same list); `PASS ATC-06`: 288 calls of each list well under 50 ms in total (the uncached jar: roughly 0.2 s per call, the 58 s JEI page)
@fails ATC-03 FAIL: `ready()` false on a running server (registry not reported locked), so nothing is cached
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
> atctest
waitlog \[atctest\] (PASS|FAIL) ATC-06 300
expect \[atctest\] PASS ATC-03
expect \[atctest\] PASS ATC-06

## SQ-ATC-04 | Armor Trims list rebuilt after the tag reload (follows SQ-PF-05's reloads)
@group same
@commands `/reload`, wait for it, `/atctest` again
@pass `PASS ATC-07` (trimmable list rebuilt after the tag reload), ATC-02 to -06 PASS again, same counts as before the reload; reload time no worse than 28 s
@fails NOT rebuilt: `TagsUpdatedEvent` listener not registered (`ArmorTrimsItemCache.init` in `CreativeEngineering`)
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> reload
waitlog Loaded \d+ pocket computer upgrades 300
sleep 10
> atctest
waitlog \[atctest\] (PASS|FAIL) ATC-07 300
expect \[atctest\] PASS ATC-07
count \[atctest\] PASS ATC-0[3-6] == 4
look counts against SQ-ATC-02's lines; the reload (Reloading! to the pocket computer line) no worse than 28 s

