@@text Results 2026-10-27 evening run (Run log): SQ-ATC-01 to -04 PASS (probe fixed: `java.lang.System` is class-filtered): 226 items = registry scan, 288 calls 0-2 ms, list rebuilt after `/reload`. CQ-ATC-01 to -03 open (client). 2026-10-27 night (perf.md 12, throwaway client, three joins): CQ-ATC-01 PASS: `[jei] Armor Trims pages: 288 trim recipe(s), 25 template upgrade recipe(s)`, JEI start 15.8 / 18.6 / 17.0 s (89 / 77 s), Play to playable 47-48 s; no JEI plugin over 1.2 s. CQ-ATC-02, -03 not run (need eyes on the page and a smithing table).
